        <rect class="hot" x="310" y="30" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="370" y="51" text-anchor="middle">compact</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="450" y="30" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="510" y="51" text-anchor="middle">same bytes</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="590" y="30" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="650" y="51" text-anchor="middle">same bytes</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="170" y="110" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="230" y="131" text-anchor="middle">compact</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="310" y="110" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="370" y="131" text-anchor="middle">same bytes</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="450" y="110" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="510" y="131" text-anchor="middle">same bytes</text>
        <rect class="hot" x="590" y="110" width="120" height="30" rx="6"/><text class="th" x="650" y="131" text-anchor="middle">same bytes</text>
        <text class="cap" x="20" y="88">keyword / model: exact on first exposure, compacted from the next request (if the gate allows)</text>
        <text class="cap" x="20" y="168">deterministic with first_pass: compact from the first exposure, so no later prefix rewrite</text>
